('462', 'M1483', 'Centro - Ed Tectower sala de 45m2, 2 vgs garagem ', 'xm1483', '3', '1', '', '<p>Centro, na Av Dr Nelson Dávila. Sala no Ed Tectower, andar alto, ar-condicionado novo, toalete e duas vagas de garagem, boa ventilação. Estacionamento para visitantes. Condominio de R$ 500,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1483 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1483 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1483 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1483 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1483 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1483 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1483 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1483 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/M1483 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"M1483 2.jpeg\"}}', 'rent', '', '1100.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'centro', '-23.189507,-45.885883', '12245-031', '45', '1', '1', '2', '', '0', '[\"1\",\"8\",\"22\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '234', '783', '2021-04-20 00:00:00', '783', '2021-04-20 11:29:00', '0', NULL),
('465', 'C3177', 'Bosque Dos Ipes - Sobrado Geminado 3 Dorms (suite) 2 vgs garagem', 'xc3177', '7', '1', '', '<p>Sobrado geminado no Bosque dos Ipês, de 3 dormitórios sendo uma suite com sacada, armários embutidos, cozinha planejada, piso frio, jardim de inverno, 2 vagas cobertas de garagem.</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 6.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 6.jpeg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 7.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 7.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 10.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 10.jpeg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 9.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 9.jpeg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 8.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 8.jpeg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery20\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery19\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3177 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3177 3.jpeg\"}}', 'sell', '', '460000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Bosque Dos Ipes', '-23.255152,-45.894779', '12236-883', '230', '3', '2', '2', '', '0', '[\"8\",\"17\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '237', '783', '2021-04-16 00:00:00', '783', '2022-06-24 17:00:53', '0', NULL),
('468', 'T1117', 'Cond Residencial Mantiqueira - lote de 253m2 próximo a quadra', 'xt1117', '6', '1', '', '<p>Terreno no Condominio fechado, Residencial Mantiqueira, 253m2, leve aclive, com calçada pronta próximo às quadras e área de lazer. Ótimo condominio com duas quadras, playground, praças, lago com peixes, sendo permitido pesca, quiosques com churrasqueira, localizado em região com ótima vista, muita natureza e próximo ao Centro da cidade e saída para Campos do Jordão. Condominio de R$ 450,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 1.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 2.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 4.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 6.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 9.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 11.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 11.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 14.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 14.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 10.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 10.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 13.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 13.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 3.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 7.jpg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 8.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 12.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 12.jpg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 17.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 17.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 16.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 16.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1117 15.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1117 15.jpg\"},\"gallery19\":{\"photo\":