('533', 'A5232', 'Centro- Apto 2 Dormitórios, armários, andar alto, Sem Garagem', 'xa5232', '1', '1', '', '<p>Apto de andar alto no Cond. Jeronimo Carnevalle, de  2 dormitórios, armários, vista livre, cozinha com armários, banheiro de empregada, piso em taco, Sem garagem. Região central com praça na frente, muitos comércios, bancos, farmácias. Condominio de R$ 625,00</p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 0.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 0.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 2.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 2.JPG\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 1.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 1.JPG\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 3.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 3.JPG\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 4.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 4.JPG\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 7.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 7.JPG\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 9.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 9.JPG\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 6.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 6.JPG\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 5.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 5.JPG\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 8.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 8.JPG\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 10.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 10.JPG\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 14.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 14.JPG\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 12.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 12.JPG\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 11.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 11.JPG\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 13.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 13.JPG\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 15.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 15.JPG\"},\"gallery21\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 20.JPG\",\"alt_text\":\"A5232 20.JPG\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A5232 17.JPG\",\"alt_text