('822', 'C3255', 'Sunset Park - Sobrado: 3D (3 Suítes); Escritório; 6 Banheiros; Armários; Coz. Planejada; Piscina; Área Gourmet; Varanda; 4 Vagas.', 'xc3255', '7', '1', '', '<div class=\"spproperty-short-overview-text\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Sobrado de alto padrão no Condomínio Sunset Park- Jd. Aquarius.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Possui 3 Quartos, sendo todos suítes, Escritório, 6 Banheiros, Lavabo, Salas de estar e jantar, Lareira, Área Gourmet com banheiro, Piscina, Piso Laminado e Garagem com 4 vagas, sendo 2 cobertas.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Condomínio Fechado com Segurança 24h. R$550,00.</span></p>\r\n</div>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3255 1.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3255 2.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3255 3.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3255 4.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3255 5.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3255 6.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"C3255 7.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/C3255 8.jpg\",\"alt_te