('906', 'T1149', ' Lote no Condomínio Verana - Putim: 361m2; Área de Lazer Completa', 'xt1149', '6', '1', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Descrição:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Terreno em aclive ideal para quem quer um projeto com vista panorâmica. Na parte mais alta do condomínio Verana, em frente a praça central e vizinho da área verde (vista permanente).</span> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">CONDOMÍNIO </span>LAZER:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- SALÃO DE FESTAS</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- CHURRASQUEIRA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- PLAYGROUND</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- BRINQUEDOTECA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- SALÃO DE JOGOS</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- QUADRA DE TÊNIS</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- QUADRA POLIESPORTIVA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- PISCINA ADULTO</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- PISCINA INFANTIL</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- ACADEMIA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- LAGO DE PESCA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- PRAÇAS COM BRINQUEDOS</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- ACADEMIA A CÉU ABERTO</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">NATUREZA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- 60% Área verde - Áreas de proteção permanente.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Área com árvores frutíferas e árvores ornamentais</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Mais de 5 nascentes de água</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">SEGURANÇA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- 42 câmeras de monitoramento de alta definição.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Portaria 24 horas / 7 dias por semana.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Ronda motorizada 24 horas / 7 dias por semana.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Perímetro todo murado com cerca elétrica.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Reconhecimento de morador por biometria e aproximação.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">DIFERENCIAL</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Distância de apenas 5 minutos da Embraer.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Localizado a 6 minutos do Aeroporto de São José dos Campos.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Próximo à Faculdade de Medicina Metodista - apenas 3 minutos.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Maior ciclovia da cidade passando na porta, interligando a Zona Norte até o Aeroporto e Via Dutra, com mais de 10 km de extensão.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Acesso para a Via Dutra e Ayrton Senna por avenidas de pista dupla.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">- Acesso direto para a Tamoios (Litoral Norte de SP)</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 5.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 5.jpeg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 6.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 6.jpeg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 7.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 7.jpeg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 9.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 9.jpeg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 12.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 12.jpeg\"},\"gallery8\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 8.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 8.jpeg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1149 10.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1149 10.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery