('952', 'A7660', 'Urbanova - Apto 2 Dorms (1Ste), 2 Banh, Coz planejada, Arm embutidos, Sacada Gourmet, 2 Vg Gar', 'xa7660', '1', '1', '', '<p>Apartamento à venda no bairro Urbanova com <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">59 metros de área útil; - piso todo em porcelanato; - 2 dormitórios com armários,  sendo uma  suíte;-  01 banheiro social; Banheiros com box, espelho  e armários; área gourmet com pia e churrasqueira; - Sala dois ambientes;- cozinha com armários  e área de serviço; - gás somente para o fogão;- armário no corredor; </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">2 vagas de garagem cobertas.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Salão de Festas, Elevador, Condomínio Fechado com Segurança 24h por R$390.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Proximo da Igreja Santo Agostinho,  do supermercado Máximo, da feira livre  às terças-feiras, academias e tb ponto de ônibus em frente. </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"> M</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">uito ventilado e ensolarado, ótima localização,  não tem barulho da avenida, muito silencioso, pois não fica voltado para  a avenida.</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/a.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"a.jpeg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/b.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"b.jpeg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 1.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 1.jpeg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery18\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.04 3.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.04 3.jpeg\"},\"gallery17\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.02 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery19\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.03.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.03.jpeg\"},\"gallery21\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.04 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.04 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery22\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.03 2.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.03 2.jpeg\"},\"gallery24\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.03 4.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.03 4.jpeg\"},\"gallery23\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.04.jpeg\",\"alt_text\":\"WhatsApp Image 2022-01-25 at 12.14.04.jpeg\"}}', 'sell', '', '365000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Urbanova', '-23.203629,45.949818', '