Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Equipamentos de ginástica ao ar livre</span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">; </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Circuito de caminhada com 1,3 Km</span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">; </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Pista de Pump Track para Bike, Skate, Patins e Patinete; </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Salão de Festas e </span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Espaço gourmet com</span><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\"> 2 Churrasqueiras.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Condomínio Fechado; Segurança e Portaria 24h.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"> </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1153 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1153 1.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1153 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1153 2.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1153 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1153 3.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '266000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Jd. Das Flores', '-23.149320,-45.804710', '12247-004', '250', '0', '0', '0', '', '0', '[\"12\",\"16\",\"18\",\"21\",\"23\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2022-03-05 00:00:00', '783', '2022-03-10 11:45:26', '0', NULL),
('1004', 'A7688', ' Jd. Santa Inês III - Apto 2D, 1 Banheiro, Cozinha Planejada; Armários Embutidos; 1 Vaga', 'xa7688', '1', '1', '', '<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Apartamento de 2 dormitórios a venda no bairro Jd. Santa Inês III com: </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- 1 Banheiro</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Conceito aberto, com bancada de madeira náutica e mesa suspensa, tudo feito em madeira teca e acabamento em resina. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Cozinha planejada (com espaço reservado para instalação de lava e seca, tanque ou máquina de lavar convencional) </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Bancada equipada com torre de tomadas embutida. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Fechadura Digital embutida </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Apartamento com PISO VINÍLICO </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Recém pintado com tinta à prova d\'Água </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Lâmpadas em LED </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Sala planejada com painel de TV </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Cozinha planejada com compartimento exclusivo para itens de limpeza, como rodo, vassouras, pás, além de compartimento de lixeira embutida.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\"> - Insulfilm em todas as janelas garantindo maior privacidade. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- 1 Vaga de garagem</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Localizado a 5 minutos da Fatec, Unifesp e Parque Tecnológico. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Saída para a Dutra sentido Rio e SP. </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Detalhamento de itens que acompanham o imóvel: </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- Painel de tv - Tv 42 polegadas Led </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- 2 puffs </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- sofá NOVO ( 3 meses) </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- 2 cadeiras Eiffel </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- nicho suspenso </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- persiana BLACKOUT </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- fogão cooktop </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- forno elétrico </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- geladeira INVERSE </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- cama box </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- closet aberto </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">- espelho banheiro</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Condomínio Fechado, Salão de Festas e Segurança 24h por R$180</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Apenas venda.</span></p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 1.jpg\"},\"gallery15\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 8.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 8.jpg\"},\"gallery14\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 7.jpg\"},\"gallery13\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 6.jpg\"},\"gallery16\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 9.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 9.jpg\"},\"gallery9\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 2.jpg\"},\"gallery10\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 3.jpg\"},\"gallery12\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 5.jpg\"},\"gallery11\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/A7688 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"A7688 4.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '204000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'São José dos Campos', 'Jd. Santa Inês III', '-23.168508,-45.790398', '12248703', '40', '2', '1', '1', '', '0', '[\"8\",\"10\",\"16\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2022-03-05 