('1043', 'T1156', 'Terras do Vale - Terreno 343 m² em Cond. Fechado', 'xt1156', '6', '1', '', '<p>Cond. Terras do Vale - Terreno 343 m² em condomínio fechado de alto padrão com fácil acesso às principais vias da cidade. Vista permanente.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>O condomínio inclui quatro quiosques com churrasqueira, salão de festas, brinquedoteca, salão de jogos, playground, bocha, quatro quadras poliesportivas, campo de society e quadra de tênis.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Documentação em dia.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>', '', NULL, NULL, '{\"gallery1\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1156 1.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1156 1.jpg\"},\"gallery2\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1156 2.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1156 2.jpg\"},\"gallery5\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1156 5.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1156 5.jpg\"},\"gallery3\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1156 3.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1156 3.jpg\"},\"gallery6\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1156 6.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1156 6.jpg\"},\"gallery7\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1156 7.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1156 7.jpg\"},\"gallery4\":{\"photo\":\"images\\/gallery\\/T1156 4.jpg\",\"alt_text\":\"T1156 4.jpg\"}}', 'sell', '', '285000.00', '', '', 'BRL:R$', '1', 'show', '12', 'BR', 'Caçapava', 'Av. das Palmeiras', '-23.128966,-45.735611', '12294-412', '343', '0', '0', '0', '', '0', '[\"12\",\"16\",\"21\",\"23\",\"24\"]', '', '', '', '{}', '1', '*', '1', '0', '783', '2022-03-17 00:00:00', '783', '2022-03-18 16:18:14', '0', NULL),
('1047', 'C3334', 'Jd. Rodolfo - Sobrado 150 m²: 3D (Suíte c/ Closet+Sacada); 4 Banheiros; Cozinha planejada; Sala Ampla; 2 Vagas', 'xc3334', '7', '1', '', '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Sobrado à venda no Jd. Rodolfo com 3 Dormitórios (uma suíte com closet e sacada), 2 banheiros sociais, 2 vagas de garagem cobertas, </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">cozinha planejada, Sala ampla c/ painel de TV, Área de serviço, Área gourmet com churrasqueira c/ ducha e banheiro</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\"><br />Escada c/design moderno (corrimão de inox)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Área de serviço c/dispensa;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Projeto único</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Obra feita com matérias de primeira linha</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Casa localizada no final da rua(sem saída)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">- Ótima localização (bairro projetado p/condomínio fechado)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Terreno 159 m2</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-index: 2; color: #000000; font-family: Catamaran, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; z-index: 2; color: #4a4a4a; font-family: \'Nunito Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-line;\">Área construída 190 m2</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; z-inde